WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.552
Start with the smallest model that meets the task's quality requirement.

00:00:04.552 --> 00:00:12.567
If it passes the evaluation set, a larger model may add cost and latency without creating meaningful value.

00:00:12.567 --> 00:00:17.892
Scale up only when measured failures justify the extra capability.

00:00:17.892 --> 00:00:25.005
Smaller models can also be easier to host privately, scale horizontally, and update quickly.
